sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Usuario as Usuário
    participant Browser
    participant React as React Frontend
    participant Controller as ReconciliationController
    participant Service as ReconciliationService
    participant Repo as ReconciliationRepository
    participant TxRepo as TransactionRepository
    participant EntryRepo as StatementEntryRepository
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Usuario, DB: Fluxo: Confirmar Conciliação

    Usuario ->> React: Clica em "Confirmar Conciliação"\n(transactionId: 42, statementEntryId: 108)

    React ->> Browser: Exibe modal de confirmação\ncom dados da transação e do extrato

    Usuario ->> React: Confirma a operação\n(adiciona observação opcional)

    React ->> Controller: POST /api/reconciliations/confirm\n{ transactionId: 42, statementEntryId: 108, notes: "..." }

    Note over Controller: Verifica autenticação via\ncookie de sessão

    Controller ->> Service: confirmReconciliation(dto, user)

    Service ->> TxRepo: findByIdAndUser(42, user)
    TxRepo ->> DB: SELECT * FROM transactions\nWHERE id=42 AND account.user_id=user.id
    DB -->> TxRepo: Transaction entity
    TxRepo -->> Service: Transaction (status: pending)

    Service ->> EntryRepo: findByIdAndUser(108, user)
    EntryRepo ->> DB: SELECT * FROM statement_entries\nWHERE id=108 AND account.user_id=user.id
    DB -->> EntryRepo: StatementEntry entity
    EntryRepo -->> Service: StatementEntry (status: pending)

    Service ->> Service: Verifica mesma conta:\ntransaction.account_id === entry.account_id

    Service ->> Repo: findActiveByTransaction(transaction)
    Repo ->> DB: SELECT * FROM reconciliations\nWHERE transaction_id=42\nAND undone_at IS NULL
    DB -->> Repo: NULL (não há conciliação ativa)
    Repo -->> Service: NULL (ok para prosseguir)

    Service ->> Repo: findActiveByStatementEntry(statementEntry)
    Repo ->> DB: SELECT * FROM reconciliations\nWHERE statement_entry_id=108\nAND undone_at IS NULL
    DB -->> Repo: NULL (não há conciliação ativa)
    Repo -->> Service: NULL (ok para prosseguir)

    Note over Service, DB: Abre transação de banco de dados

    Service ->> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION

    Service ->> Repo: createReconciliation(\n  transaction, statementEntry, user, notes\n)
    Repo ->> DB: INSERT INTO reconciliations\n(transaction_id, statement_entry_id,\nreconciled_by, reconciled_at, notes)\nVALUES (42, 108, user.id, NOW(), ...)
    DB -->> Repo: Reconciliation (id: 7)

    Service ->> TxRepo: updateStatus(transaction, "reconciled")
    TxRepo ->> DB: UPDATE transactions\nSET status='reconciled', updated_at=NOW()\nWHERE id=42
    DB -->> TxRepo: OK

    Service ->> EntryRepo: updateStatus(statementEntry, "reconciled")
    EntryRepo ->> DB: UPDATE statement_entries\nSET status='reconciled'\nWHERE id=108
    DB -->> EntryRepo: OK

    Service ->> DB: COMMIT

    DB -->> Service: Transação confirmada

    Service -->> Controller: Reconciliation entity (id: 7)

    Controller -->> React: HTTP 201 Created\n{\n  id: 7,\n  transactionId: 42,\n  statementEntryId: 108,\n  reconciledAt: "2024-03-15T14:00:00+00:00",\n  reconciledBy: { id: 1, name: "João" }\n}

    React ->> React: Remove sugestão da lista\nAtualiza status das transações em cache\n(React Query invalidation)

    React -->> Usuario: Exibe toast de sucesso:\n"Conciliação confirmada com sucesso!"

    Note over Usuario, DB: Fluxo: Desfazer Conciliação

    Usuario ->> React: Clica em "Desfazer Conciliação"\n(reconciliationId: 7)

    React ->> Browser: Exibe modal de confirmação\ncom campo de motivo

    Usuario ->> React: Informa motivo e confirma

    React ->> Controller: POST /api/reconciliations/7/undo\n{ reason: "Valor divergente" }

    Controller ->> Service: undoReconciliation(7, reason, user)

    Service ->> Repo: findById(7)
    Repo ->> DB: SELECT * FROM reconciliations WHERE id=7
    DB -->> Repo: Reconciliation (undone_at: NULL)
    Repo -->> Service: Reconciliation (ativa)

    Note over Service, DB: Abre transação de banco de dados

    Service ->> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION

    Service ->> Repo: markAsUndone(reconciliation, user, reason)
    Repo ->> DB: UPDATE reconciliations\nSET undone_at=NOW(), undone_by=user.id,\nnotes=reason\nWHERE id=7
    DB -->> Repo: OK

    Service ->> TxRepo: updateStatus(transaction, "pending")
    TxRepo ->> DB: UPDATE transactions\nSET status='pending', updated_at=NOW()\nWHERE id=42
    DB -->> TxRepo: OK

    Service ->> EntryRepo: updateStatus(statementEntry, "pending")
    EntryRepo ->> DB: UPDATE statement_entries\nSET status='pending'\nWHERE id=108
    DB -->> EntryRepo: OK

    Service ->> DB: COMMIT

    Service -->> Controller: Resultado do desfazimento

    Controller -->> React: HTTP 200 OK\n{\n  id: 7,\n  undoneAt: "2024-03-16T09:00:00+00:00",\n  undoneBy: { id: 1 },\n  transactionStatus: "pending",\n  statementEntryStatus: "pending"\n}

    React ->> React: Atualiza cache\nTransação volta para lista de pendentes

    React -->> Usuario: Exibe toast:\n"Conciliação desfeita com sucesso."
